00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:30.079
...say that the

00:10:30.079 --> 00:10:32.880
digit can be used, kind of all singing or

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:34.160
dancing

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:36.240
number digit just like all the others,

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:37.519
that was the Indians.

00:10:37.519 --> 00:10:39.360
It was moving it from a kind of

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:41.600
placeholder to realising that no no it

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:43.680
can actually behave really really well.

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:45.600
And even when it appeared in India it

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:47.440
took centuries

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:49.200
for people to actually begin to play

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:50.880
around with it and realise

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:53.600
that you know-

